# The other half of dezolis_prism.route: a new game on the same cell has
# no Prism, loc_92CC leaves the map alone, and the step up onto Ikuto's
# block is an ordinary step on open ground.

start level 3 88 8
wait idle
shot 01_below_ikuto
walk up 1
wait idle
expect level 3 88 7
shot 02_open_ground
expect no-stderr map_patches
